'''Cobblestone''' is a {{Common}} Block, obtained from mining [[Stone]], Cobblestone, or from [[Cobblestone Minion]]s.

== Collection ==
Collecting cobblestones increases the player's cobblestone [[Collections|collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of cobblestones.
{{/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Cobblestone}}

== Obtaining ==
'''Cobblestone''' can be obtained from mining [[Stone]] or '''Cobblestone''' found in the [[Private Island]] (and 8 can be found in the starter chest), [[Coal Mine]], [[Gold Mine]], [[Deep Caverns]], [[Dwarven Mines]] and [[Crystal Hollows]]. Mining Stone or Cobblestone grants {{Green|+1}} {{Skillname|Mining|XP}}.

